      "About 30 g of protein per serving, enough to match a 25 g whey scoop on leucine",
      "NSF Certified for Sport, per the brand and NSF listing at the time of writing",
      "Multi-source legume blend covers amino acid gaps better than single-source pea"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Mid-to-premium cost per 25 g of protein",
      "Stevia-sweetened flavors draw aftertaste complaints from some buyers"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "If you want one plant protein that gets dose, testing and sourcing right, this is the one to buy.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "About 30 g (label, varies by flavor)",
      "Calories": "About 160-170 (flavor-dependent)",
      "Third-party tested": "NSF Certified for Sport (verify flavor)",
      "Best for": "Lifters and tested athletes"
    }
  },
  {
