    "description": "Naked Pea has one ingredient: yellow pea protein, sourced from US and Canadian farms according to the brand. That gives it the best protein-per-calorie ratio on our list, about 27 g in roughly 120 calories, and makes it the easiest to cook with. It suits people who want to control exactly what goes into their shake and are not chasing a sport certification.",
