            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">That is roughly the amount needed to match the leucine in a standard 25 g scoop of whey. If your tub lists 20 g per serving, use one and a half servings after training, or have the shake with a meal that adds protein of its own.</p>
