          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best plant-based protein powder for most people is Garden of Life Sport Organic Plant-Based Protein: about 30 g of protein per serving, a multi-source blend and NSF Certified for Sport status, with Vega Sport a near tie. On a budget, NOW Sports Pea Protein and Naked Pea give you clean, unflavored pea protein at the lowest cost per 25 g, as long as you blend them into something.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
